EPAE Release Notes – Firestore Data Load

Purpose:
Populate the missing Firestore fields required by GTS as part of the effort to sunset the GEMS stored procedure.

Fields being populated:

* terminationReasonCode
* employeeJobDotQualifier

Implementation:
A one-time Python script will be executed to identify the applicable Firestore documents and populate the missing fields.

Pre-Deployment:
A backup/export of the GCP Firestore data will be taken before running the script.

Validation:
After the script completes, the updated Firestore records will be validated to confirm that the required fields were populated correctly.

Rollback / Backout:
If any issue is identified during or after the data load, the Firestore backup taken before implementation will be used to restore the data to its previous state.

Application Impact:
No application code deployment is involved. This is a one-time Firestore data update.

Expected Downtime:
No downtime is expected.